WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

The permission above applies to THIS PLUGIN and nothing else: the resolver
script in `bin/`, the hook configuration in `hooks/`, the MCP server entry in
`.mcp.json`, and the slash commands and skills written in Markdown. Port them
to another coding agent, fork them, ship them — that is the point of the licence
being this one.

It does NOT license `@stringlane/cli`. The plugin RUNS that program; it does not
contain it, and the two are distributed separately. `@stringlane/cli` is free of
charge under its own terms, which are in the `LICENSE` file inside that npm
package.

It does NOT license the StringLane desktop application, which is a paid product
under separate terms at https://stringlane.app/terms.
